<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Molly's Chambers</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Kings of Leon</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Youth And Young Manhood</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">0nCAVzknkzRXRgB6LhRv04</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.480" end="00:15.790">Free that's all that she could bleed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.790" end="00:17.290">That's why she'll never stay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.260" end="00:19.950" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.950" end="00:22.320">White bare naked in the night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.320" end="00:24.130">And lookin' for some play</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.130" end="00:25.750" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.750" end="00:28.820">Just another girl that wants to rule the world</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.820" end="00:30.950">Any time or place</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.950" end="00:32.950" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.950" end="00:35.320">And when she gets into your head</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.320" end="00:37.220">You know she's there to stay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.220" end="00:40.330" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.330" end="00:43.080">You want it, she's got it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.080" end="00:46.080">Molly's chamber's gonna change your mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.080" end="00:49.750">She's got your, your pistol</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.750" end="00:52.940">Molly's chamber's gonna change your mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.940" end="00:56.130">Molly's chamber's gonna change your mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.130" end="00:58.310">Slow she's burnin' in your soul</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.310" end="01:00.330">With whispers in your ear</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.330" end="01:02.520" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.520" end="01:05.210">It's okay I'll give it anyway</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.210" end="01:07.400">Just get me out of here</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.400" end="01:09.020" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.020" end="01:11.460">You'll plead, you'll get down on your knees</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.460" end="01:13.480">For just another taste</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.480" end="01:15.610" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.610" end="01:17.920">And when you think she's let you in</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.920" end="01:20.230">That's when she fades away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.230" end="01:22.860" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.860" end="01:25.800">You want it, she's got it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.800" end="01:28.930">Molly's chamber's gonna change your mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.930" end="01:32.180">She's got your, your pistol</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.180" end="01:35.350">Molly's chamber's gonna change your mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.350" end="01:40.700">Molly's chamber's gonna change your mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.700" end="01:48.700" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.820" end="01:54.820">You want it, well she's got it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.820" end="01:58.080">Molly's chamber's gonna change your mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.080" end="02:01.010">She's got your, your pistol</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.010" end="02:04.390">Molly's chamber's gonna change your mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.390" end="02:07.460">You want it, she's got it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.460" end="02:10.890">Molly's chamber's gonna change your mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.890" end="02:14.890">She's got your, your pistol</p></div></body></tt>